\pard\f0\fs21\li0 - Mission: Build a fully owned, original, commercially viable AI-native DSA/competitive-programming/ICPC practice system that competes on user value with LeetCode, Codeforces, AtCoder, HackerRank and AI coding assistants.\par 
\pard\f0\fs21\li0 - Existing foundation: One Next.js/Monaco + Better Auth + FastAPI + SQLite-owned-submission-queue + gVisor judge monorepo. Do not restart it.\par 
