\pard\f0\fs21\li0 - Exactly two primary solver research references: https://github.com/kagnlp/CodeGenerator (CodeSIM/MapCoder, MIT) and https://github.com/Nan-Do/phi-code (Apache-2.0). Study design patterns only, not unsafe executors.\par 
\pard\f0\fs21\li0 - Immediate next step: Review PR #5 and merge only after maintainer approval; then start threat-model/budget ADR for a real model provider, not paid inference or GPU training.\par 
