\pard\f0\fs21\li0 Trust boundaries: Browser sessions belong to Better Auth, not to the FastAPI service; FastAPI verifies EdDSA signature, fixed issuer, solver-api audience and subject. Submission records are scoped to verified user. Only the trusted judge worker leases and completes jobs using its separate credential; generated grading case expectations never go to web/API model context. The worker refuses ordinary-host/ordinary-Docker execution if gVisor preflight fails. No unrestricted exec, eval or host subprocess for generated/user code.\par 
\pard\sa100\par 
