\pard\f0\cf1\b\fs27 Task 2 \u8212? Analyze all twenty public study repositories\b0\cf0\fs22\sa100\par 
\pard\sa100\par 
\pard\f0\fs21\li0 Treat docs/PUBLIC_REPOSITORIES_AND_RESOURCES.txt as the master inventory. Evaluate upstream URLs, default branches, relevant commit SHAs, primary architecture, maintenance/release condition, license/commercial obligations, security, compatibility with current code, safe dependencies vs concepts to reimplement, complexity and practical value. Verify important facts from upstream original README, source, manifests, tests, LICENSE and docs. Distinguish evidence from assumptions. Never automatically clone or import all 20.\par 
